    {
      "id": "claim_f50376f4f86244a2af3bd6abd50d6a6a",
      "statement": "render_card in src/paraphe/adapters/telegram.py is the layout owner the destination holds: a pure function from the notification payload to Telegram HTML text, called only by TelegramAdapter.notify, which ships that text with parse_mode=\"HTML\" and performs the network call, so the renderer itself does no I/O and knows nothing about chat ids, message ids or card versions.",
      "evidence": [
        {
