      "id": "claim_2874f84acc0440cc919e5f1590d48094",
      "statement": "A card with no choices gets no numbered list in its text while both the inline keyboard (_markup) and the inbox's claim validation (_claim_locked) fall back to [\"Approve\", \"Deny\"]; since request_approval and request_feedback reject choices at create time and only ask_question and update_request set them, an approval card's options normally exist only as buttons.",
