      "statement": "The numbered options are a legend for the buttons, not the answer channel: the number is the choice's list position, the same order _markup enumerates into the version-bound callback_data token, and an answer resolves as a choice index against the card's own choices at claim time, so no number in the rendered text is ever parsed back as an answer.",
