      "id": "claim_e0c75d08407642f2baef7218544f68ad",
      "statement": "Every interpolated value passes _sanitize (a utf-8 \"replace\" round-trip that replaces a lone surrogate so a field cannot fail the send) and then html.escape(..., quote=False), while a link's href is escaped with quote=True; the only markup that can survive a hostile field is the renderer's own bold labels, the bold title and its anchors.",
