    {
      "id": "claim_c92126813ada48438e9e6b5e2a718a5b",
      "statement": "_fit recomposes and re-measures the whole message on each round, picks the longest trimmable _Piece above _MIN_TRIM_UNITS + _MARKER_UNITS, and cuts that piece's raw text with _shrink — a binary search for the longest head whose rendered length fits the remaining room with the marker paid for, floored at _MIN_TRIM_UNITS — and when no piece qualifies a safety valve empties the trimmable raws longest-first, so the renderer always returns a string instead of raising.",
