    {
      "id": "claim_2d1373f927a74302a1a2e4efc7f09515",
      "statement": "The budget guarantee stops where trimmable content stops: because the identity line, kind line, title, reply hint and expiry cannot be trimmed and escaping expands \"&\" fivefold (a URL ticket is escaped twice, once for the href and once for the visible text), a card whose oversized content sits only in those fields renders over PLATFORM_LIMIT with nothing the loop may cut, and the failure surfaces as a Telegram rejection (NotifyRejected, which rolls the notification reservation back) rather than as an exception in the renderer.",
